      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "**দৃষ্টব্য:** ক) $m = 0$ অথবা $<u>u</u> = <u>0</u>$ হলে $m<u>u</u> = <u>0</u>$ খ) $1<u>u</u> = <u>u</u>, (-1)<u>u</u> = -<u>u</u>$",
