    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c12-t12.6-p012",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "তখন $\\overrightarrow{AG} = \\overrightarrow{AB} + \\overrightarrow{BC} + \\overrightarrow{CD} + \\overrightarrow{DE} + \\overrightarrow{EF} + \\overrightarrow{FG} = <u>u</u> + <u>u</u> + <u>u</u> + <u>u</u> + <u>u</u> + <u>u</u> = 6<u>u</u>$ অন্যদিকে $\\overrightarrow{AG} = \\overrightarrow{AC} + \\overrightarrow{CE} + \\overrightarrow{EG} = 2<u>u</u> + 2<u>u</u> + 2<u>u</u> = 3(2<u>u</u>)$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\overrightarrow{AG} = \\overrightarrow{AB} + \\overrightarrow{BC} + \\overrightarrow{CD} + \\overrightarrow{DE} + \\overrightarrow{EF} + \\overrightarrow{FG} = <u>u</u> + <u>u</u> + <u>u</u> + <u>u</u> + <u>u</u> + <u>u</u> = 6<u>u</u>",
        "\\overrightarrow{AG} = \\overrightarrow{AC} + \\overrightarrow{CE} + \\overrightarrow{EG} = 2<u>u</u> + 2<u>u</u> + 2<u>u</u> = 3(2<u>u</u>)"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 282,
      "pdfPageEnd": 283,
      "printedPageStart": 277,
      "printedPageEnd": 278,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c12-t12.6-p013",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "এবং $\\overrightarrow{AG} = \\overrightarrow{AD} + \\overrightarrow{DG} = 3<u>u</u> + 3<u>u</u> = 2(3<u>u</u>)$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\overrightarrow{AG} = \\overrightarrow{AD} + \\overrightarrow{DG} = 3<u>u</u> + 3<u>u</u> = 2(3<u>u</u>)"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 283,
      "pdfPageEnd": 283,
      "printedPageStart": 278,
      "printedPageEnd": 278,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
